---
// Kev's own story, in his words (lightly cleaned up from his voice note). First person on purpose:
// this page is personal, unlike the rest of the site, which speaks as the studio ("we").
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Meet Kev" description="Kev's story: self-doubt, trust and why Reliable Kev Media tells real stories." quote={false}>
  <article class="story">
    <h1>Meet Kev</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      I have never been someone who's comfortable in front of the camera. Even recording myself, I've carried a sense
      of insecurity and self-doubt that I have always struggled with.
    </p>

    <figure class="single before">
      <img src="/images/kev-before-front.jpg" alt="Kev four years ago, flexing in his bedroom" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>Four years ago.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p>
      Through my own effort, I've learned what it means to put yourself in a place where you have to trust yourself,
      and trust someone else to capture you.
    </p>

    <blockquote class="pull">Trust yourself, and trust someone to capture you.</blockquote>

    <figure class="single">
      <img src="/images/kev-before-after.jpg" alt="Kev before and after, side by side" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>Then and now.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p>
      That's where this is going, and it's why I tell other people's stories. I've never been someone who connects
      easily with groups. I connect with people one on one. That's why so much of my work is filming one-on-one with
      business owners, letting them tell their story.
    </p>
    <p>
      A lot of people just want help with their business. To me, that's not the right place to start. The approach I
      bring is the full context: how you started, and why you're doing this in the first place. Documentary style.
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/start" class="btn btn-primary">Tell your story</a>
      <a href="/about" class="btn">About the studio</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Page>

<style>
  .story { max-width: 680px; }
  .story p { font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .lead { font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.4vw, 1.4rem) !important; color: var(--text) !important; }
  .single img { width: 100%; display: block; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .before { max-width: 340px; }
  .single { margin: 32px 0; }
  figcaption { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 6px; }
  .pull {
    margin: 32px 0; padding: 4px 0 4px 22px; border-left: 3px solid var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem); line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 36px; }
</style>
